<title>SWEDEN: TI says completes Forsheda takeover.</title>
<headline>TI says completes Forsheda takeover.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering firm TI Group Plc on Monday said it had completed its takeover of Swedish polymer maker Forsheda and now controlled 78.7 percent of the total shares and 90.2 percent of the votes.</p>
</text>
